{"2646450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Who Are You!?", "steam_appid": 2646450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/88450728834eee91eb33bb8b769e7d9a.avif?t=1782871126\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Are You!? is a sci-fi psychological horror game, where you'll face the unknown in order to save your family.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <strong>DISCLAIMER</strong> ⚠️</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an episodic game. The first episode will be released in Q1 2026. Purchasing the first episode will grant you access to Episodes 2 and 3 when they're released.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a deep, engaging experience with an immersive narrative, so pay attention to your surroundings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used for art, sound design or development in this game. Every aspect crafted by human hands and creativity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/e7ef420909baf2cbbbde92b6c7df1a3e.avif?t=1782871126\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research Collaboration Notice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who Are You!? is developed with the support and insights of renowned Argentine ufologists Silvia and Andrea Pérez Simondini.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silvia is a pioneering UFO researcher, founder of the UFO Museum in Victoria, Entre Ríos, and director of the research group Visión OVNI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Andrea is Director of CEFORA and South America Continental Director for ICER, recognized internationally for her work on UAPs and anomalous phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their real-world investigations and knowledge have helped shape the game's narrative and authenticity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/ec6fda8f3361ed2f1b61436be01811ca.avif?t=1782871126\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative based on true ufology stories and investigations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional and psychological interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/42216c9425eaab406fcc84fe2635a42c.poster.avif?t=1782871126\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/42216c9425eaab406fcc84fe2635a42c.webm?t=1782871126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/42216c9425eaab406fcc84fe2635a42c.mp4?t=1782871126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/deb42aae8b118838ea21956d787d0e7f.avif?t=1782871126\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The story follows Ray Roswell, who lost his wife 20 years ago. Now, his only daughter has gone missing. In his search for her, Ray not only embarks on a physical journey but also confronts the emotional and psychological trauma of his past, reliving the pain he has tried to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/ea644a0e4e382154dc6093e2306bc30f.poster.avif?t=1782871126\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/ea644a0e4e382154dc6093e2306bc30f.webm?t=1782871126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/ea644a0e4e382154dc6093e2306bc30f.mp4?t=1782871126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/88450728834eee91eb33bb8b769e7d9a.avif?t=1782871126\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Are You!? is a sci-fi psychological horror game, where you'll face the unknown in order to save your family.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <strong>DISCLAIMER</strong> ⚠️</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an episodic game. The first episode will be released in Q1 2026. Purchasing the first episode will grant you access to Episodes 2 and 3 when they're released.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a deep, engaging experience with an immersive narrative, so pay attention to your surroundings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used for art, sound design or development in this game. Every aspect crafted by human hands and creativity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/e7ef420909baf2cbbbde92b6c7df1a3e.avif?t=1782871126\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research Collaboration Notice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who Are You!? is developed with the support and insights of renowned Argentine ufologists Silvia and Andrea Pérez Simondini.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silvia is a pioneering UFO researcher, founder of the UFO Museum in Victoria, Entre Ríos, and director of the research group Visión OVNI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Andrea is Director of CEFORA and South America Continental Director for ICER, recognized internationally for her work on UAPs and anomalous phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their real-world investigations and knowledge have helped shape the game's narrative and authenticity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/ec6fda8f3361ed2f1b61436be01811ca.avif?t=1782871126\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative based on true ufology stories and investigations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional and psychological interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/42216c9425eaab406fcc84fe2635a42c.poster.avif?t=1782871126\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/42216c9425eaab406fcc84fe2635a42c.webm?t=1782871126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/42216c9425eaab406fcc84fe2635a42c.mp4?t=1782871126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/deb42aae8b118838ea21956d787d0e7f.avif?t=1782871126\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The story follows Ray Roswell, who lost his wife 20 years ago. Now, his only daughter has gone missing. In his search for her, Ray not only embarks on a physical journey but also confronts the emotional and psychological trauma of his past, reliving the pain he has tried to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/ea644a0e4e382154dc6093e2306bc30f.poster.avif?t=1782871126\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/ea644a0e4e382154dc6093e2306bc30f.webm?t=1782871126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/ea644a0e4e382154dc6093e2306bc30f.mp4?t=1782871126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Who Are You!? is a sci-fi psychological horror experience based on real UFO research. The story centers on Ray Roswell and his internal fight to understand the disappearance of his wife, which may involve an alien abduction.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Por